          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli iri hoót baraá yaamaá Misrír wa alé, dirka ta bay Gosheni, daqaari'iima kari sláy, tari doogín nee tari ló' wa tlaáhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo iri hoót baraá yaamaá Misrír wa alé, har afi qoomár kureeraá mibaá nee faanqw. Yakobo kureeraá aa hoót a tsiiru nee mibeeri tsiyáhh nee faanqw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelór gwa'arár Israeli iwa naká/, garmaawós Yosefu guri ateét, guri báy, «Án kuúng bir tsuwa slá', dakók qaaseek gawaá nawdueé', nee al'axweesani ooang, ar án kuúng iwa ilaiwa/amér looeemií tlehh, aníng mi baloó baraá yaamaá Misrír i foolaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala án bara gwaá', huwáng, foolár awáng amoodá' taati'iieé' ki foliít.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
